Files in this directory and their licence:
- original/*.txt: unchanged copies of the libical files. They stay under
  MPL-2.0.
- cases.json: the same test cases in the format of tests/Corpus. It is a
  modified form of the original files, so it also stays under MPL-2.0.
  tools/extract_libical.py makes it. Changes: each block becomes one case;
  the comment becomes "description"; a DATE value of DTSTART gets
  ";VALUE=DATE"; "INSTANCES: *** <text>" becomes "expectedError"; the cases
  that need ICU (non-Gregorian RSCALE) and the UNIMPLEMENTED case get a
  "skip" note.

